From: PS5_MihawkOS Contributors
Subject: [PATCH] gpu-broker: support 1440p (2560x1440) and 4K (3840x2160) display output

Parameterize Ps5GpuDisplay, GPU broker protocol bounds, overlay/HUD scaling, and
Vulkan WSI display extents for 1080p, 1440p, and 4K output with graceful fallback
to 1080p when VideoOut refuses a higher mode.

---
